Z||000009||kslish||10-22-2001||12:19 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>Geeez, who drove that *tacky* maroon GT without the hood??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey Lisa, lay off my GT!!  Besides, it was looking "ghetto fabulous" going back home with the black hood that I got off of Doug, in addition to the multitude of other parts that I managed to stuff into the car.  I swear, I was like a kid in a candy store in Doug's parts storage room.  I'll take one of these, and two of these, and....<P>By the way, those tinted sail panel windows had your name all over them.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ken S.||||reg||1
